@startuml d09_state_marks
!include _style.iuml
' Figure title: Statechart diagram: life cycle of a marks record

[*] --> NoMarks
state "No marks" as NoMarks : no row in marks
state "Internal only" as Internal : external_marks = NULL\ntotal, grade = NULL
state "Graded" as Graded : total = internal + external\ngrade set by trigger
state "Re-graded" as Regraded : new total and grade\naudit row written

NoMarks --> Internal : save internal only
NoMarks --> Graded : save internal + external
Internal --> Graded : save external
Graded --> Regraded : marks changed\n[old <=> new is false]
Regraded --> Regraded : marks changed again
Graded --> Graded : re-save same values\n/ no audit row
Internal --> Internal : change internal
Graded --> [*] : enrollment deleted\n(ON DELETE CASCADE)
Regraded --> [*] : enrollment deleted
@enduml
